  "description": "What a deed does to the Hearth/Hollow axis and to Renown, and what it becomes when somebody sees it. `hearth` moves the morality axis (-100 Hollow .. +100 Hearth); `renown` is how much the world learns to speak of you. `witness_renown` is added per witness (capped by witness_cap) because Renown is anchoring, not vanity: a deed nobody saw barely holds. `rumour` names the rumour template that enters the nearest place's pool when the deed is witnessed; `heat` is how strongly it spreads (see systems/factions/gossip.gd). `gossip_only` deeds change nothing by themselves and exist so the world can talk.",
